```Title: Shell or Script Host Connected to an Uncommon Port (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1571 | Severity: low | Sigma id: 26deebc2-c2f4-43f6-bbe2-7baa496e905c```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 3 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Administration scripts that connect to databases, SSH or custom application ports```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity low.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=3
(Initiated="true" Image IN ("*\\powershell.exe", "*\\pwsh.exe", "*\\cmd.exe", "*\\mshta.exe", "*\\wscript.exe", "*\\cscript.exe", "*\\rundll32.exe", "*\\regsvr32.exe", "*\\MSBuild.exe") NOT (DestinationPort IN (53, 80, 88, 135, 389, 443, 445, 636, 3268, 5985, 5986, 8080, 8443)))
| table _time host User Image Protocol Initiated SourceIp SourcePort DestinationIp DestinationPort
